<title>ITALY: ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>SESTRIERE, Italy 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times after the</p>
<p>first leg of the women's slalom at the Alpine skiing world</p>
<p>championships on Wednesday (65 gates, vertical drop 180 metres):</p>
<p>1. Karin Roten (Switzerland) 52.62 seconds</p>
<p>2. Deborah Compagnoni (Italy) 52.67</p>
<p>3. Elfi Eder (Austria) 52.70</p>
<p>4. Marlies Oester (Switzerland) 52.73</p>
<p>5. Claudia Riegler (New Zealand) 52.79</p>
<p>6. Sabine Egger (Austria) 52.80</p>
<p>7. Lara Magoni (Italy) 53.08</p>
<p>8. Patricia Chauvet (France) 53.31</p>
<p>9. Pernilla Wiberg (Sweden) 53.43</p>
<p>10. Hilde Gerg (Germany) 53.80</p>
<p>11. Elisabetta Biavaschi (Italy) 53.82</p>
<p>12. Trine Bakke (Norway) 53.89</p>
<p>13. Ingrid Salvenmoser (Austria) 54.06</p>
<p>14. Emma Carrick-Anderson (Britain) 54.20</p>
<p>15. Morena Gallizio (Italy) 54.29</p>
</text>
